      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">How To Get Started This Week</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        If you're a pastor or volunteer coordinator reading this, here's the 5-day plan:
      </p>

      <ol class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 mb-6 list-decimal pl-6">
        <li><strong class="text-gray-900">Monday:</strong> Sign up for a free trial at <a href="https://www.whatstheprocessfor.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors underline">whatstheprocessfor.com</a>. Mint an API key. Connect Claude Desktop.</li>
